<description>&lt;p&gt;Rebel forces clashed with government troops near the Uganda border, leaving one dead and three injured. Communal violence in Tonj East and Tonj North has escalated, with death tolls reaching 84, according to Apa.az, and churches urging urgent action. In the Upper Nile region, fighting since March 2025 has displaced 125,000 people and killed 180, prompting a UN envoy to call for consensus among leaders. Opposition leader Machar continues to dispute Bol Mel’s claims over the Nasir attack, while Odinga has appealed for international intervention after meeting President Kiir. The UCDP recorded 2 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxPcUlCZzJFdzBSRXpud2FDSnB0ZWJwTEJENVEtSFN0WFZQQ2FrVHo2Y2c4ejhSYWpXemJrTExMcE5IbWZsYlNNeklvTHd6UGtFWWp0alpUOGwzY1lWbFlhMUwtQkFOaW5uS1NuTGNiUWdZZWM2Z2IwVG1qMzRhVnFKVUhDZE42VGwxOUpDVGNOenlZUkV1MWlYTEJXWFBucmdBWEFTVk9qSzBxSE5BVms4dXRRSC1CcjlQUGlqYnJBQzd5ZEt3RG8tSg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Monitor&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxOWWpSV0ZhMTZNM2NLZWk5d1NjV0h1b1dkdTBsclR2X2pVY0hyNWJOcFN1dGlhWmhyd2Y5UTNKU0s0LXVJSmZNMXZwMWRNZEtmU1h5M1Y4S3RtQjBzVm5ZUExURnFPWEQ2UjB6TTRxbjB5NEthaGppS1VWSTB0aXNpYnFB?oc=5&quot;&gt;NTV Uganda&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxOV3ItRHNWY0x2Snh6OGliQmY3bUNIMWVjajB6WkktcllJWnF2M1ZaRmFJN0staEhqbnBjMFA5QjRYcjBUZ3VCaFRwZ0xjUEpmdzZ1dUFsbXlVdmlDYUE0dktHNXM2ZnFoQm44QlF5MEs2NXdabmRKZkFKNjNzWXhnVnREM3UyQ3pfOExudEJmWDZIWHBfaTNUM3cwUFJRU2N2VGc0aHR2OA?oc=5&quot;&gt;ohchr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxPd0c5LU9CVHcwenhtcFJNLXhBd2Vqd3JrU2MzYjh3aTRwdHpqeUMwMXFCcmsyWXVNMjNqVEVQeWR1d2kzcGZUWUFlRE